@* R2-18: a secondary explanation of the pipeline setup screens is an OE tooltip on a question mark,
   readable by keyboard and by screen readers, instead of a sentence in the page. R-22: the text is shown whole, never
   cut to a preview with the OE "Show more" action (CompactLength 0): a hint of a few hundred characters opened in the
   banner as that action alone, without its text. *@
<OmniTooltip Text="@Text" Focusable="true" MaxWidth="OmniTooltipWidth.Wide" CompactLength="0">
    <span role="img" aria-label="@Text" data-testid="pipeline-info-tip"><OmniIcon Name="OmniIconName.Question" Class="omni-u-text-muted" aria-hidden="true" /></span>
</OmniTooltip>
